---
import statementImg from "../assets/home poster.jpg";
---

<section id="movement" class="relative py-24 md:py-32 bg-zinc-950 overflow-hidden border-t border-b border-white/10">
  <div class="absolute inset-0">
    <img src="/background/background1.jpeg" alt="FASTian Spirit background" class="h-full w-full object-cover opacity-25" />
  </div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/45"></div>
  <!-- Background Noise + Subtle Red Radial Blur -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 noise opacity-30 pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute -top-40 -left-40 w-96 h-96 bg-red-900/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute -bottom-40 -right-40 w-96 h-96 bg-red-900/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Text Content Side -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-center">
        
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-red-950/80 border border-red-800/60 w-fit mb-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-red-400">The FASTian Spirit</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-bebas text-5xl sm:text-7xl tracking-tight leading-none text-white mb-6">
          IT’S NOT JUST A CLUB.<br />
          <span class="text-red-600">IT’S A MOVEMENT.</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-zinc-300 font-normal leading-relaxed mb-6">
          The <strong class="text-white">FAST NUCES Peshawar Sports Society</strong> is the official student section and athletic engine of FAST Peshawar — one of the loudest, most electric student communities in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa. When you enter the ground, you’re not just watching a match... <span class="text-red-400 font-semibold">you’re becoming part of something bigger.</span>
        </p>

        <!-- Quote Block -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-black/60 border border-red-900/40 backdrop-blur-md mb-8 relative">
          <div class="absolute -top-3 right-6 px-3 py-0.5 bg-red-600 text-white font-bebas text-sm tracking-wider uppercase rounded">
            Our Core Philosophy
          </div>
          <p class="font-bebas text-2xl sm:text-3xl tracking-wide text-zinc-100 leading-snug">
            “WE BRING THE NOISE. WE BRING THE PASSION. WE CREATE THE ATMOSPHERE THAT KNOCKS OPPONENTS OFF THEIR GAME AND GIVES FAST A TRUE HOME-GROUND ADVANTAGE.”
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-zinc-400 italic">
            — FAST NUCES Peshawar Cyclones Student Section Manifesto
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="text-base text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          It’s not just about showing up. It’s about showing out. Wear the crimson red, fill your lungs, and shout for the team. Be part of a timeless campus tradition.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="/fixtures"
            class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white font-extrabold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-red-950/60 hover:scale-105 transition-all"
          >
            Sports Week (5 - 8 Oct)
          </a>
          <a
            href="/sports"
            class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 hover:text-white font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase rounded-full border border-zinc-700 transition-all"
          >
            Sports Rules & Format
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Image & Badge Side -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
        <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-red-900/40 group">
          <video
            src="/videos/fastian_spirit_section_video.mp4"
            autoplay
            muted
            loop
            playsinline
            poster={statementImg.src}
            class="w-full h-[450px] sm:h-[550px] object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-transparent to-black/30"></div>
          
          <!-- Overlay Badge -->
          <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <img src="/logos/website_favicon.png" alt="FAST Society Emblem" class="h-12 w-auto object-contain" />
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bebas text-xl text-white tracking-wider leading-none">FAST PESHAWAR SPORTS SOCIETY</h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-red-400 font-semibold mt-1">Established for Student Athletes & Passionate Supporters</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
